{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-029",
    "title": "失去的童年"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_159",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "顾长离把铜针递给他：“看针尾。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "暗道出口通向一座荒废的山寺。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5035,
          "end": 5035
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临、顾长离和叶观澜从雪坡下钻出时，天色已近黄昏。山寺只剩半边屋顶，残墙上覆着厚雪。慧闻没有跟来，玄霄宗追兵也暂时被堵在暗道里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5037,
          "end": 5037
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这里曾是无相寺的分院。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5039,
          "end": 5039
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5041,
          "end": 5041
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在只剩一张桌子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5043,
          "end": 5043
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "桌子确实还在，桌面嵌着一块黑色石板。石板中央有一道圆形凹槽，凹槽边缘刻着三方印记。顾长离把顾氏旧印按上去，石板立刻亮起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5045,
          "end": 5045
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令。”慧闻的声音从屋外传来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5047,
          "end": 5047
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他踏雪进寺，手里捧着无相铜镜。镜面结着霜，却能照出石板上的字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5049,
          "end": 5049
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灵脉异动期间，玄霄宗、归墟盟、无相寺暂止争夺；持印者不得开启天门；任何一方不得独自改写记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5051,
          "end": 5051
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三方代表随后依次落签：玄霄宗以白玉令画押，归墟盟以刀锋割掌，无相寺以经文盖印。没有一方愿意承担回川城的代价，却都承认这是共同决定。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5053,
          "end": 5053
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看完笑了：“第三条是写给谁的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5055,
          "end": 5055
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻答：“写给所有人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5057,
          "end": 5057
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗的灰袍修士从残墙外走来。他身后只剩两名弟子，衣袍结满霜花。灰袍修士把白玉令牌放进石板凹槽，石板上的玄霄宗印记随即变得清晰。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5059,
          "end": 5059
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令必须签。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5061,
          "end": 5061
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们刚才还要抓人。”顾长离道。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5063,
          "end": 5063
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令之前，各守其责。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5065,
          "end": 5065
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令之后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5067,
          "end": 5067
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“共同阻止天门开启。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5069,
          "end": 5069
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向石板底部：“代价写在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5071,
          "end": 5071
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5073,
          "end": 5073
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻转动铜镜。镜中浮出一座灵脉城的影像。城中仍有灯火，屋顶有人走动，孩童在街边堆雪。城心却有一道青色裂缝，正慢慢向城墙延伸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5075,
          "end": 5075
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令会把异动锁在这座城。”慧闻说，“城里的人会成为锚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5077,
          "end": 5077
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们会怎样？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5079,
          "end": 5079
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灵脉平息，他们失去部分记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5081,
          "end": 5081
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果灵脉不平息？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5083,
          "end": 5083
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城会先塌。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5085,
          "end": 5085
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离盯着镜中孩童：“你们要拿活人封门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5087,
          "end": 5087
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士说：“这是最小的代价。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5089,
          "end": 5089
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁决定最小？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5091,
          "end": 5091
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“天下需要继续运转。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5093,
          "end": 5093
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜把手按在刀柄上：“归墟盟不会签。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5095,
          "end": 5095
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士看他：“不签，天门今夜就会开。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5097,
          "end": 5097
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“开门未必比封门更糟。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5099,
          "end": 5099
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你愿意让城里的人先死？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5101,
          "end": 5101
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜的嘴唇抿成一线。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5103,
          "end": 5103
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可城里还有人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5129,
          "end": 5129
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们不知道自己已经被牺牲。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5131,
          "end": 5131
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临感到掌心两枚残印同时震动。金色裂纹在气海中扩大，第二道劫雷的余威尚未散去，第三道雷云已在雪原上方聚拢。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5133,
          "end": 5133
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不签。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5135,
          "end": 5135
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士抬剑：“你没有资格决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5137,
          "end": 5137
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我持有残印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5139,
          "end": 5139
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以你必须被控制。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5141,
          "end": 5141
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离站到陆照临前面：“先过我这一关。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5143,
          "end": 5143
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜也拔刀：“归墟盟不签。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5145,
          "end": 5145
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻闭上眼，木珠在掌心一颗颗滑过：“无相寺不签，但会留下见证。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5147,
          "end": 5147
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士看着三方：“那就让回川城的人为你们的选择承担。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5149,
          "end": 5149
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他抬起白玉令牌，石板上的封天令开始自动书写。黄纸上浮出三方印记，最后一栏却没有签名，只留一道空白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5151,
          "end": 5151
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁签下空白，谁承担城中所有被删去的记忆。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5153,
          "end": 5153
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向黄纸。空白处逐渐浮出一个名字：陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5155,
          "end": 5155
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯在。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-102",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5237,
          "end": 5237
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻指向城中最高的钟楼。钟楼上悬着三盏灯，第一盏和第二盏已经点亮，第三盏仍然熄灭。每当钟声响起一次，城里便有一批人忘记自己的住处。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5315,
          "end": 5315
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“必须熄灭前两盏？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5317,
          "end": 5317
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不能。它们是封天令的锚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5319,
          "end": 5319
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就点第三盏。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5321,
          "end": 5321
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“点亮第三盏，城门会完全开启。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5323,
          "end": 5323
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向钟楼：“封天令说三日后开门，为什么现在已经有两盏亮了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5325,
          "end": 5325
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻答：“因为持印者的记忆正在替它倒计时。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5327,
          "end": 5327
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临摸向胸口。半枚残印的青光沿经脉流动，气海里的金色裂纹比昨日更明显。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5329,
          "end": 5329
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我忘了什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5331,
          "end": 5331
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你自己知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5333,
          "end": 5333
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临试着回忆七岁那场雨。槐树、空灯、沈砚秋，他都记得。唯独陆沉舟最后说了什么，始终想不起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5335,
          "end": 5335
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把铜针递给他：“看针尾。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5337,
          "end": 5337
        }
      }
    ],
